{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，奔馳CTO約爾格·布爾策在媒體圓桌會議上坦承，<strong>品牌早年推出的L3級自動駕駛實用性受限，奔馳已調整技術路線，優先打磨高階L2輔助駕駛，未來計劃跳過L3、直接衝刺L4。他直言，「搶先推出新技術，不代表就能滿足消費者的實際需求。」</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585448.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.658070+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:06:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"09b3f537b3d508e415e32006a93e39ee9d1d2b440d0a7a84e1fb17a06ba5dc1e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}